        "PMC7512559::chunk::003::discussion::49b8051d92"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The creep mechanism is influenced by the coatings' unique microstructure and chemical composition.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The initial material is a high-entropy-alloy multilayer protective coating with a unique microstructure and chemical composition.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
