      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7512559::chunk::000::abstract::cb41644a7c"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The relevant test conditions are 500–600 °C and 140–400 MPa.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7512559::chunk::000::abstract::cb41644a7c"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dislocation climb is a structural mediator of the time-dependent deformation response.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7512559::chunk::000::abstract::cb41644a7c",
        "PMC7512559::chunk::003::discussion::49b8051d92"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dynamic recrystallization is a structural mediator of the time-dependent deformation response.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7512559::chunk::000::abstract::cb41644a7c",
        "PMC7512559::chunk::003::discussion::49b8051d92"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coatings will have greater resistance to time-dependent plastic deformation than conventional alloys.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The baseline should be a conventional alloy with similar chemical composition but without the high-entropy alloy's unique microstructure.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed mechanism is applicable to high-entropy-alloy multilayer protective coatings with the specified microstructural and compositional characteristics.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
